## F. Algoritma

Gunakan `algorithm` + `algpseudocode` packages. Caption `Algoritma I.1` (sesuaikan format dengan figure/table). **Setiap algoritma yang dirujuk** harus diberi `\label{alg:...}`.

```latex
\begin{algorithm}[ht]
  \caption{Top-k Sparse Autoencoder, satu langkah maju.}
  \label{alg:topk-sae}
  \begin{algorithmic}[1]
    \Require Input $\mathbf{x} \in \mathbb{R}^{d}$, parameter $k$
    \State $\mathbf{x}' \gets \mathbf{x} - \mathbf{b}_{\text{pre}}$
    \State $\mathbf{z} \gets \mathbf{W}_{\text{enc}} \mathbf{x}'$
    \State $\mathcal{T} \gets \operatorname{TopK\text{-}index}(\mathbf{z}, k)$
    \State $\mathbf{z}_{\text{sparse}} \gets \mathbf{0};\;\; \mathbf{z}_{\text{sparse}}[\mathcal{T}] \gets \operatorname{ReLU}(\mathbf{z}[\mathcal{T}])$
    \State $\hat{\mathbf{x}} \gets \mathbf{W}_{\text{dec}} \mathbf{z}_{\text{sparse}} + \mathbf{b}_{\text{pre}}$
    \State \Return $\hat{\mathbf{x}}, \mathbf{z}_{\text{sparse}}$
  \end{algorithmic}
\end{algorithm}
```

